  "label": "Meme format: 'showing the kids you can do it too'",
  "description": "This meme format is a common internet meme structure used to convey encouragement or empowerment. It typically features a person (often a celebrity or public figure) interacting with a child or group of children, with text overlaying the image to suggest that the person is demonstrating a skill or attitude that the children can emulate. The format relies on the viewer's understanding of motivational messaging and public figures as role models.",
